[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7262.31, "timestamp": "02:01:02", "text": "如此。螃蟹區。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7284.55, "timestamp": "02:01:24", "text": "。  這裡總是螃蟹出沒的地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7296.149, "timestamp": "02:01:36", "text": "呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7318.149, "timestamp": "02:01:58", "text": "，我該往左走嗎？  左邊。  是從這裡經過的嗎？  這是真的嗎？"}]